  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Brottsf&#xf6;reb. fas 2 EST</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crime prev phase 2 EST</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Samarbetet syftar till att bygga upp strukturer f&#xf6;r brottspreventivt arbete f&#xf6;r att tackla en &#xf6;kande brottslighet i Estland. Samarbetet omfattar tv&#xe5; lokala pilotprojekt kring brottsf&#xf6;rebyggande. Syftet &#xe4;r att den estniska parten ska bygga upp kompetens att p&#xe5; egen hand organisera och driva brottsf&#xf6;rebyggande projekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The cooperation is aimed at devising preventive structures and measures to tackle the increasing criminality in Estonia. The cooperation entails two local projects who will serve as  pilot-projects. The purpose is that Estonia will acquire the skills needed to develop their own models for future crime prentive work.</narrative>
  </description>
